- confirm_operator_alignment shift_candidate_alpha driver_operator_alpha
- assign_compliance_certificate shift_candidate_alpha compliance_certificate_alpha
- verify_compliance_certificate shift_candidate_alpha compliance_certificate_alpha
- finalize_candidate_after_compliance_validation shift_candidate_alpha
- release_compliance_certificate shift_candidate_alpha compliance_certificate_alpha (to make it available)
- allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate shift_candidate_alpha dispatch_slot_alpha route_task_profile_alpha (requires dispatch_ready ?candidate, which we have after finalize? Actually finalize sets dispatch_ready ?candidate. Yes finalize_candidate_after_compliance_validation effect includes dispatch_ready ?candidate. So we can allocate dispatch slot after finalize.
- execute_schedule_dispatch shift_candidate_alpha vehicle_unit_alpha dispatch_slot_alpha
- detach_task_profile shift_candidate_alpha route_task_profile_alpha (optional, to free task profile for later use)
- release_operator_resource shift_candidate_alpha driver_operator_alpha (to free operator for later use)
- (vehicle will be made available by execute_schedule_dispatch effect)
- (dispatch slot made available by execute_schedule_dispatch)
- (compliance certificate made available by release)

